{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DpvsEwUoYh6zYfb6wvtr19","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2\t\"\"\"PostToolUse observer hook: verify sub-agent SKILL.md re-hash post-Read.\n3\t\n4\tPLAN-020 Phase 2 v1 (ADR-051 §Sub-agent obligation) — v1 baseline\n5\temits `reference_postread_observed` breadcrumb on every SKILL.md\n6\tRead.\n7\t\n8\tPLAN-045 F-10-07 v2 (Session 43 round-8) — extends v1 with:\n9\t\n10\t- Spawn-correlation lookup: scans recent audit-log.jsonl events for\n11\t  the matching spawn event (by session_id + skill_path) and extracts\n12\t  the `claimed_sha` from the spawn prompt's `## SKILL REFERENCE` line.\n13\t- Reconciliation emits:\n14\t  - `skill_reference_read_mismatch` if pinned sha != read-time sha\n15\t  - `skill_reference_read_stale` if spawn event is >5min older than\n16\t    the Read (TOCTOU plausibility window)\n17\t- Session-state file at\n18\t  `~/.claude/projects/<slug>/state/skill-read-sessions/<session_id>.jsonl`\n19\t  tracks already-reconciled (session_id, skill_path) pairs so the\n20\t  same Read across multiple sub-agent spawns doesn't re-emit.\n21\t\n22\tKill-switch: `CEO_SKILL_READ_V2=0` disables the v2 layer, retains v1\n23\tbaseline behavior.\n24\t\n25\t## Threat model\n26\t\n27\tThe spawn-time hook `check_agent_spawn.py::_validate_skill_reference`\n28\tverifies the SKILL.md SHA-256 hash matches the pinned hex at SPAWN.\n29\tBetween that check and the sub-agent's first Read of the file, an\n30\tattacker could swap the file (TOCTOU). v1 observer detected the Read\n31\tbut did not COMPARE. v2 compares + flags + leaves forensic trail.\n32\t\n33\t## Wire-up\n34\t\n35\tRegistered in `.claude/settings.json` PostToolUse Read.\n36\t\n37\t## Fail-open\n38\t\n39\tAny internal error → silent allow + breadcrumb. Observer must NEVER\n40\tblock sub-agent execution.\n41\t\n42\t## Limitations\n43\t\n44\t- Never-read detection deferred (would require SessionEnd hook to\n45\t  walk pending entries).\n46\t- Audit-log lookup scans last N events (bounded at 500 for perf);\n47\t  very-long sessions may miss older spawns. Acceptable — TOCTOU is\n48\t  most plausible in the minutes-to-hours window, not days.\n49\t\"\"\"\n50\t\n51\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n52\t\n53\timport hashlib\n54\timport json\n55\timport os\n56\timport re\n57\timport sys\n58\tfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n59\tfrom pathlib import Path\n60\tfrom typing import Any, Dict, Iterable, List, Optional, Tuple"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f14aefec-dd31-41ef-96b5-86b1c0aa1232","uuid":"fe733a87-8a09-4346-a75c-625ac1a72d48","timestamp":"2026-11-15T10:43:58.037Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/9n/hm9srl0s1nz45_p12tj61pd80000gn/T/kit-repass-tree.tG8bbW/tree/.claude/hooks/check_skill_reference_read.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"PostToolUse observer hook: verify sub-agent SKILL.md re-hash post-Read.\n\nPLAN-020 Phase 2 v1 (ADR-051 §Sub-agent obligation) — v1 baseline\nemits `reference_postread_observed` breadcrumb on every SKILL.md\nRead.\n\nPLAN-045 F-10-07 v2 (Session 43 round-8) — extends v1 with:\n\n- Spawn-correlation lookup: scans recent audit-log.jsonl events for\n  the matching spawn event (by session_id + skill_path) and extracts\n  the `claimed_sha` from the spawn prompt's `## SKILL REFERENCE` line.\n- Reconciliation emits:\n  - `skill_reference_read_mismatch` if pinned sha != read-time sha\n  - `skill_reference_read_stale` if spawn event is >5min older than\n    the Read (TOCTOU plausibility window)\n- Session-state file at\n  `~/.claude/projects/<slug>/state/skill-read-sessions/<session_id>.jsonl`\n  tracks already-reconciled (session_id, skill_path) pairs so the\n  same Read across multiple sub-agent spawns doesn't re-emit.\n\nKill-switch: `CEO_SKILL_READ_V2=0` disables the v2 layer, retains v1\nbaseline behavior.\n\n## Threat model\n\nThe spawn-time hook `check_agent_spawn.py::_validate_skill_reference`\nverifies the SKILL.md SHA-256 hash matches the pinned hex at SPAWN.\nBetween that check and the sub-agent's first Read of the file, an\nattacker could swap the file (TOCTOU). v1 observer detected the Read\nbut did not COMPARE. v2 compares + flags + leaves forensic trail.\n\n## Wire-up\n\nRegistered in `.claude/settings.json` PostToolUse Read.\n\n## Fail-open\n\nAny internal error → silent allow + breadcrumb. Observer must NEVER\nblock sub-agent execution.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- Never-read detection deferred (would require SessionEnd hook to\n  walk pending entries).\n- Audit-log lookup scans last N events (bounded at 500 for perf);\n  very-long sessions may miss older spawns. Acceptable — TOCTOU is\n  most plausible in the minutes-to-hours window, not days.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\nimport sys\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom typing import Any, Dict, Iterable, List, Optional, Tuple","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":537}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DpvsEwUoYh6zYfb6wvtr19","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
